From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:41:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 41/49] dt-bindings: usb: dwc2: Add Ingenic X2600

The X2600 has two DWC2 controllers. Their cores are what the X2000
parameters of the driver assume (16 host channels, a 16-bit UTMI
interface, room for its host FIFOs in their 3576 words of FIFO RAM),
so the X2000 compatible serves as fallback.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml
index 6c3a10991..a748046bd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,9 @@ properties:
       - const: ingenic,x1700-otg
       - const: ingenic,x1830-otg
       - const: ingenic,x2000-otg
+      - items:
+          - const: ingenic,x2600-otg
+          - const: ingenic,x2000-otg
       - items:
           - const: rockchip,rk3066-usb
           - const: snps,dwc2
